{"revision_id":"343cc396ce017934e15f863226b8b69c96a57bb7ee7d76cf650abed25b139dae","source_id":8,"person_ref":null,"state_ref":null,"json_pointer":"/data/atlas/theaters/2/travel_constraints/seasonal_conditions/0","row_key":"[8,\"WNA-001\",\"[8,\\\"WNA-001\\\",\\\"[8,\\\\\\\"WNA-001\\\\\\\",null,\\\\\\\"text_atlas\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"/data/atlas\\\\\\\"]\\\",\\\"text_atlas_theaters\\\",\\\"XT03\\\"]\",\"text_atlas_theaters_travel_constraints_seasonal_conditions\",\"/data/atlas/theaters/2/travel_constraints/seasonal_conditions/0\"]","parent_key":"[8,\"WNA-001\",\"[8,\\\"WNA-001\\\",null,\\\"text_atlas\\\",\\\"/data/atlas\\\"]\",\"text_atlas_theaters\",\"XT03\"]","ordinal":0,"member_key":null,"value__type":"object","en__type":"string","en":"Before departure, the watch inspects icing along each segment in perpetual winter, checks preheating power and seal condition, and records the passable segments in the ledger.","ko__type":"string","ko":"출발 전 당직자는 영구 겨울 속 구간별 결빙을 살피고 예열 전력과 밀봉 상태를 대조하여 통행 가능한 구간을 장부에 적는다."}
