{"revision_id":"343cc396ce017934e15f863226b8b69c96a57bb7ee7d76cf650abed25b139dae","source_id":8,"person_ref":null,"state_ref":null,"json_pointer":"/data/atlas/theaters/2/travel_constraints/seasonal_conditions/2","row_key":"[8,\"WNA-001\",\"[8,\\\"WNA-001\\\",\\\"[8,\\\\\\\"WNA-001\\\\\\\",null,\\\\\\\"text_atlas\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"/data/atlas\\\\\\\"]\\\",\\\"text_atlas_theaters\\\",\\\"XT03\\\"]\",\"text_atlas_theaters_travel_constraints_seasonal_conditions\",\"/data/atlas/theaters/2/travel_constraints/seasonal_conditions/2\"]","parent_key":"[8,\"WNA-001\",\"[8,\\\"WNA-001\\\",null,\\\"text_atlas\\\",\\\"/data/atlas\\\"]\",\"text_atlas_theaters\",\"XT03\"]","ordinal":2,"member_key":null,"value__type":"object","en__type":"string","en":"When dust and differential-pressure trouble appeared, the medical and goods convoys went through a protection procedure separate from the interpretation check.","ko__type":"string","ko":"먼지와 차압 문제가 생기면 의료·물자 호송은 통역 확인과 별도로 방호 절차를 거친다."}
